  "description": "A local studio for SenseNova U1.5 Lite: text-to-image and image editing with local archiving and a draggable, git-like time tree. 基于 SenseNova U1.5 Lite 的本地图像创作台：文生图 / 图片编辑，结果自动归档，可用可拖拽的类 git 时间树从任意历史节点开分支。",
